{"title": "Houndmaster's Mark", "pageid": 28225, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Houndmaster's_Mark", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hunter%27s_Mark.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Hunter%27s_Mark.webp/300px-Hunter%27s_Mark.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Hunter%27s_Mark.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Hunter%27s_Mark.webp/300px-Hunter%27s_Mark.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Hunter%27s_Mark.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Houndmaster's Mark</b> is a special version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/20px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/40px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/20px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\">Hunter's Mark</a> exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster_Pol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Houndmaster Pol\">Houndmaster Pol</a>. This action applies a mark to a target which reduces its armour class by 3. Whenever the houndmaster's dogs (<a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>) damage the marked target, they gain temporary hit points and a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prey Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\">Prey Essence</a>. This essence can then be transferred to the houndmaster to empower his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grave Shot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grave_Shot\" title=\"Grave Shot\">Grave Shot</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nYour target becomes <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster%27s_Prey_(Condition)\" title=\"Houndmaster's Prey (Condition)\">Marked</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_Houndmaster_HoundmastersMark</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Houndmaster_HoundmastersMark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_Houndmaster_HoundmastersMark\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Houndmaster.27s_Prey\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Houndmaster's_Prey\"> Condition: Houndmaster's Prey </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster%27s_Prey_(Condition)\" title=\"Houndmaster's Prey (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Houndmaster's Prey\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster%27s_Prey_(Condition)\" title=\"Houndmaster's Prey (Condition)\">Houndmaster's Prey</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity receives -3 to its <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></li>\n<li>When a Houndmaster's dog (<a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>) hits the target, it gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prey Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\">Prey Essence</a>, gaining 30 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster_Pol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Houndmaster Pol\">Houndmaster Pol</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>After applying the mark, there is a 4 round grace period before the houndmaster can reapply it to the same creature. Otherwise, he is unlimited in his use of this action and can apply it a new creature each round.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action inherits the tooltip from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/20px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/40px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/20px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\">Hunter's Mark</a> and some information shown is not true. In particular, it does not grant increased damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715061546\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3096/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41626/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16494/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1446200/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.42%   71.644     34 Template:Trim\n100.00%   67.962      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   67.962      1 -total\n 21.00%   14.273      3 Template:SmSAI\n 16.55%   11.247      6 Template:Icon_text\n 16.23%   11.032      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.64%    9.950      5 Template:Icon_link\n 11.89%    8.078      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.19%    7.608      1 Template:SmCond\n 10.27%    6.982      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28225-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715061546 and revision id 289031. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}